"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000853","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m013-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000853","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m013-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000717","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m013-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"諸呂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定官稱；不補造姓名或把身世指控當定論。"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m013-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"劉將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000853","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m013-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"劉澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000853","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m013-0095","start":95,"end":98,"surface":"瑯邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000853","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","book_id":"b-shiji-009","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-009-lvhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p025","text":"太尉絳侯勃不得入軍中主兵。曲周侯酈商老病，其子寄與呂祿善。絳侯乃與丞相陳平謀，使人劫酈商。令其子寄往紿說呂祿曰：「高帝與呂后共定天下，劉氏所立九王，呂氏所立三王，皆大臣之議，事已布告諸侯，諸侯皆以為宜。今太后崩，帝少，而足下佩趙王印，不急之國守藩，乃為上將，將兵留此，為大臣諸侯所疑。足下何不歸印，以兵屬太尉？請梁王歸相國印，與大臣盟而之國，齊兵必罷，大臣得安，足下高枕而王千里，此萬世之利也。」呂祿信然其計，欲歸將印，以兵屬太尉。使人報呂產及諸呂老人，或以為便，或曰不便，計猶豫未有所決。呂祿信酈寄，時與出游獵。過其姑呂媭，媭大怒，曰：「若為將而棄軍，呂氏今無處矣。」乃悉出珠玉寶器散堂下，曰：「毋為他人守也」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"太尉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000805","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m025-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"絳侯勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000805","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m025-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"酈商","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000765","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvho